[{"id":179904070,"discussion_id":"ebd152358c005d0a62a678b4a1285e3f41ac4028","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 主要针对 mc2 模块中多个算子内核的地址偏移计算进行整数溢出修复。通过将相关变量和参数的类型从 `int32_t` 提升为 `int64_t` 或 `uint64_t`，并在乘法运算前添加显式 `static_cast`，避免了在大规模矩阵（m、n、k 较大）场景下因 `int32_t` 溢出导致的地址计算错误。同时新增了针对 tiling 特征计算的单元测试以验证修复有效性。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`all_gather_matmul_aiv_mode.h` 偏移量类型提升**：将 `gm_a_pingpong_size`、`num_per_rank_move`、`AllGatherPerTokenScale` 的 `buff_st` 参数等多个成员和函数参数从 `int32_t` 改为 `uint64_t`/`int64_t`，并在 `Dequant`、`Process`、`MoveWithSplit`、`MoveToOtherRankWithSkip` 等处使用 `static_cast<uint64_t>` 包裹乘法运算，防止积溢出。\n\n- **`allto_all_matmul` 相关文件量化与通信偏移修复**：在 `allto_all_matmul.h`、`allto_all_matmul_util.h`、`matmul.hpp` 中，将 `QuantToken`、`QuantTokenSegment`、`CalcTokenMaxValue`、`QuantPerSegment` 等函数的 `dataOffset`/`dataTokenOffset` 参数改为 `uint64_t`，`pingPongBlockSize` 从 `uint32_t`/`int32_t` 提升为 `uint64_t`，并对相关乘法表达式添加 `static_cast<uint64_t>`。\n\n- **`matmul_allto_all` 及 `quant_matmul.hpp` 偏移计算加固**：在 `matmul.hpp` 和 `quant_matmul.hpp` 中，对 `gmOffsetA`、`gmOffsetB`、`gmOffsetC`、`gmOffsetD`、`mOffset`、`dst_offset`、`token_total` 等中间变量计算添加 `static_cast<int64_t>`，确保 `blockIdxCoord` 与 `L1TileShape::M`、`params.pValue` 等大值相乘时不溢出。\n\n- **`matmul_reduce_scatter_v2` tiling 特征计算修复**：在 `matmul_reduce_scatter_v2_aiv_mode_smallm_tiling.h` 的 `PrecomputeFeatures` 函数中，将 `m * n` 先转为 `int64_t` 再计算，避免 `MN_DIV_K` 和 `M_MUL_N` 特征值因 `int32_t` 乘积溢出而产生错误结果；`matmul.hpp` 中 `nextGmABlockSt` 同步改为 `int64_t`。\n\n- **新增单元测试验证溢出修复**：在 `test_matmul_reduce_scatter_v2_tiling.cpp` 中新增 `PrecomputeFeaturesUsesWideProduct` 测试用例，使用 m=50000、n=50000 的大值场景验证 `PrecomputeFeatures` 对 `M_MUL_N` 和 `MN_DIV_K` 特征值的计算正确性。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-14T11:15:21+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-14T11:29:19+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":179904109,"discussion_id":"b9cfa031095551c7fdb5b156aa88d2859746334e","body":"## CLA Signature Pass  \n zhu-mingzhe71, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-14T11:15:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-14T11:15:29+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":179904112,"discussion_id":"9d4586454c7ebfe81583ea947ec19ee5b5421b63","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| mc2 | ✅ [*wang-minbo*](https://gitcode.com/wang-minbo), [*liuboxi*](https://gitcode.com/liuboxi) (2/2) | ✅ [*wang-minbo*](https://gitcode.com/wang-minbo) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n zhu-mingzhe71, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-14T11:15